; cluster for rotational kinematic quantities: the time-derivative chain in rotation.
; angular-displacement → angular-velocity → angular-acceleration — each is d/dt of previous.
; the chain is: rad → rad⋅s⁻¹ → rad⋅s⁻²
; angular-velocity IS angular-frequency (omega) — connects directly to oscillation-varga.
; units: radians for angle, seconds for time
; sangati roots

(kosha rotational-motion-varga
  (vishesa kinematics-varga oscillation-varga)
  (swarupa subanta kona)
  (matra radian second)
  (yukta gati kramanusara avrti avastha))
